WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Step feet wide, toes out.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Bend knees into goddess.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Pulse an inch up and down with soft knees.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Hands at heart or on thighs.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Straighten slowly to finish.
